  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>So liest du ein Hundertstel-Feld</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;'>&#9312; Ein Feld hat 100 kleine K&auml;stchen (10 Reihen mit je 10 K&auml;stchen).<br>&#9313; Jedes K&auml;stchen ist 1 von 100 Teilen &ndash; also 1&nbsp;%.<br>&#9314; Z&auml;hlt die eingef&auml;rbten K&auml;stchen.<br>&#9315; Die Anzahl der eingef&auml;rbten K&auml;stchen ist direkt die Prozentzahl.</p></div><div class='task-block task-green' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe a)</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px 0;'>So viel Geld hat die Klassenkasse schon von ihrem Sparziel erreicht:</p><svg viewBox='0 0 198 198' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:200px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='20' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='40' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='60' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='80' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='100' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='120' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='140' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='160' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='180' y='0' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='0' y='20' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='20' y='20' width='18' height='18' rx='2' fill='#16a34a' stroke='#1